<report>
<title>Logrank and Wilcoxon tests</title>
<block name="outer">
<br />
<title><in>title</in><in>strata</in>:</title>
<block name="groups">

<p><u><subtotal>For group <in>grp</in></subtotal></u><br />
Observed deaths = <in>obs</in><br />
Extent of exposure to risk of death = <inu>ext</inu><br />
Relative rate = <inu>rel</inu></p>
</block>

<p>test statistics:<br />
<in>rank</in></p>

<p>variance-covariance matrix:</p>
<block name="covar"><p><in>mat</in></p></block>

<p>Chi-square for equivalence of death rates = <inu>chi</inu>  <pval><inp>p</inp></pval></p>
<block name="trends"><p>Chi-square for trend = <inu>trend</inu> <pval> <inp>p_trend</inp></pval></p></block>
<block name="strata">
<br />
<title><in>test</in> for COMBINED STRATA:</title>

<table>
<tr><th>Stratum</th><th>Deaths</th><th>Extent of exposure to risk of death</th><th>Relative rate</th></tr>
<block name="stratum"><tr><td><in>grp</in></td><td><in>res</in></td><td><inu>sum</inu></td><td><inu>tot</inu></td></tr></block>
</table>

<p>overall chi-square = <inu>chi_strata</inu>  <pval><inp>p_strata</inp></pval></p>
<block name="strata_trend"><p>Chi-square for trend = <inu>strata_trend</inu><pval>  <inp>p_strata_trend</inp></pval></p></block>
</block>
<block name="hazards">
<br />

<p>Hazard Ratio  <ci>(approximate <in>pc</in>% confidence interval)</ci></p>
<block name="hazard"><p><in>vs</in> = <inu>haz</inu>  <ci>(<inu>from</inu> to <inu>to</inu>)</ci></p></block>
<block name="cml">

<p>Conditional maximum likelihood estimates:<br />
Hazard Ratio = <inu>hr</inu><br />
<ci>Exact Fisher <in>pc</in>% confidence interval = <inu>llf</inu> to <inu>ulf</inu></ci><br />
<pval>Exact Fisher one sided <inp>p1f</inp>, two sided <inp>p2f</inp></pval><br />
<ci>Exact mid-P <in>pc</in>% confidence interval = <inu>llm</inu> to <inu>ulm</inu></ci><br />
<pval>Exact mid-P one sided <inp>p1m</inp>, two sided <inp>p2m</inp></pval></p>
</block>
</block>
</block>
</report>
